        },
        {
          "text": "Ngamnika u-Aroni namadodana akhe amaLevi phakathi kwabantwana bakwa-Israyeli, abe yisipho kubantwana bakwa-Israyeli, benze inkonzo yabantwana bakwa-Israyeli etendeni lokuhlangana, benzele abantwana bakwa-Israyeli ukubuyisana. Kasikho isifo phakathi kwabantwana bakoIsrayeli, lapho abantwana bakoIsrayeli besondela endlini engcwele.",
